TI  - Crop diversity induces trade-offs in microbial biopesticide susceptibility that could delay pest resistance evolution
AN  - 40392919
DO  - 10.1371/journal.ppat.1013150
IS  - 5
VL  - 21
DA  - 2025/05
PY  - 2025
T2  - PLoS pathogens
J2  - PLoS Pathog
